{
  "app": "Candidatures",
  "version": 1,
  "description": {
    "fr": "Chercher un stage, une alternance ou un emploi : ce que tu cherches et tes mots, les sites où chercher et leur recette, les offres ramenées chaque matin et notées, tes candidatures et leurs relances.",
    "en": "Looking for an internship, a work-study place or a job: what you look for and your words, the sites to search and their recipe, the offers brought back each morning and scored, your applications and follow-ups."
  },
  "models": [
    {
      "title": "JobSearch",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "Profil de recherche",
          "en": "Job search"
        },
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "poste",
            "type": "text",
            "required": true,
            "label": {
              "fr": "Poste recherché",
              "en": "Role"
            },
            "help": "Les mots de l’offre : « stage intelligence artificielle »",
            "aliases": ["query", "role", "job"]
          },
          {
            "name": "mots",
            "type": "long_text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Mes mots",
              "en": "My words"
            },
            "help": "Une idée par ligne, ses façons de la dire séparées par | : intelligence artificielle|IA|AI|machine learning",
            "aliases": ["words", "keywords", "mots_cles"]
          },
          {
            "name": "lieu",
            "type": "text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Lieu",
              "en": "Place"
            },
            "default": "France",
            "aliases": ["location", "ville"]
          },
          {
            "name": "contrat",
            "type": "choice",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Contrat",
              "en": "Contract"
            },
            "options": ["stage", "alternance", "cdi", "cdd", "freelance"],
            "optionLabels": {
              "stage": {
                "fr": "Stage",
                "en": "Internship"
              },
              "alternance": {
                "fr": "Alternance",
                "en": "Work-study"
              },
              "cdi": {
                "fr": "CDI",
                "en": "Permanent"
              },
              "cdd": {
                "fr": "CDD",
                "en": "Fixed-term"
              },
              "freelance": {
                "fr": "Freelance",
                "en": "Freelance"
              }
            },
            "aliases": ["contract"]
          },
          {
            "name": "debut",
            "type": "date",
            "label": {
              "fr": "À partir du",
              "en": "From"
            }
          }
        ],
        "columns": ["poste", "lieu", "contrat", "mots"]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Source",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "Source",
          "en": "Source"
        },
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "lien",
            "type": "url",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Lien",
              "en": "Link"
            },
            "help": "Le site, prêt à ouvrir (une recherche déjà remplie)."
          },
          {
            "name": "url",
            "type": "text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Adresse de recherche",
              "en": "Search address"
            },
            "help": "Ses {champs} prennent la valeur de chaque recherche : https://site/recherche?q={poste}&l={lieu}"
          },
          {
            "name": "active",
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "label": {
              "fr": "Parcourue chaque matin",
              "en": "Read every morning"
            },
            "help": "Non : un site à ouvrir soi-même (il bloque les robots ou demande un compte) — gardé ici avec son lien."
          },
          {
            "name": "js",
            "type": "boolean",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Construite par script",
              "en": "Built by script"
            },
            "default": false
          },
          {
            "name": "recipe",
            "type": "long_text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Recette",
              "en": "Recipe"
            },
            "help": "Écrite par l’IA (JSON) : schema { base, fields }, treg { route, body }, rename",
            "aliases": ["recette"]
          },
          {
            "name": "notes",
            "type": "long_text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Notes",
              "en": "Notes"
            }
          }
        ],
        "columns": ["lien", "active", "notes"]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "JobOffer",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "Offre",
          "en": "Job offer"
        },
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "company",
            "type": "text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Entreprise",
              "en": "Company"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "location",
            "type": "text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Lieu",
              "en": "Place"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "url",
            "type": "url",
            "unique": true,
            "label": {
              "fr": "Adresse de l’offre",
              "en": "Offer’s address"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "published",
            "type": "date",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Publiée le",
              "en": "Published"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "contract",
            "type": "text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Contrat",
              "en": "Contract"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "source",
            "type": "text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Source",
              "en": "Source"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "score",
            "type": "number",
            "min": 0,
            "max": 100,
            "label": {
              "fr": "Score",
              "en": "Score"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "reasons",
            "type": "text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Pourquoi",
              "en": "Why"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "status",
            "type": "choice",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Suite",
              "en": "Next"
            },
            "options": ["new", "interesting", "applied", "dismissed"],
            "optionLabels": {
              "new": {
                "fr": "nouvelle",
                "en": "new"
              },
              "interesting": {
                "fr": "à creuser",
                "en": "interesting"
              },
              "applied": {
                "fr": "postulée",
                "en": "applied"
              },
              "dismissed": {
                "fr": "écartée",
                "en": "dismissed"
              }
            },
            "default": "new"
          }
        ],
        "columns": ["company", "location", "score", "published", "status"]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Application",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "Candidature",
          "en": "Application"
        },
        "activity": true,
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "offer",
            "type": "link",
            "target": "JobOffer",
            "inverse": "applications",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Offre",
              "en": "Offer"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "company",
            "type": "text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Entreprise",
              "en": "Company"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "status",
            "type": "choice",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Où j’en suis",
              "en": "Where it stands"
            },
            "options": ["to_send", "waiting", "interview", "done"],
            "optionLabels": {
              "to_send": {
                "fr": "à envoyer",
                "en": "to send"
              },
              "waiting": {
                "fr": "envoyée, en attente",
                "en": "sent, waiting"
              },
              "interview": {
                "fr": "entretien",
                "en": "interview"
              },
              "done": {
                "fr": "terminée",
                "en": "over"
              }
            },
            "default": "to_send"
          },
          {
            "name": "sent_on",
            "type": "date",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Envoyée le",
              "en": "Sent on"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "due",
            "type": "date",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Relancer le",
              "en": "Follow up on"
            },
            "aliases": ["relance", "next_step"]
          },
          {
            "name": "outcome",
            "type": "choice",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Réponse",
              "en": "Answer"
            },
            "options": ["none", "yes", "no"],
            "optionLabels": {
              "none": {
                "fr": "pas encore",
                "en": "not yet"
              },
              "yes": {
                "fr": "acceptée",
                "en": "accepted"
              },
              "no": {
                "fr": "refusée",
                "en": "declined"
              }
            },
            "default": "none"
          },
          {
            "name": "contact",
            "type": "text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Contact",
              "en": "Contact"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "notes",
            "type": "long_text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Notes",
              "en": "Notes"
            }
          }
        ],
        "columns": ["company", "status", "sent_on", "due", "outcome"]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "CV",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "CV",
          "en": "CV"
        },
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "role",
            "type": "choice",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Rôle",
              "en": "Role"
            },
            "options": ["master", "tailored", "template"],
            "optionLabels": {
              "master": {
                "fr": "CV maître",
                "en": "master CV"
              },
              "tailored": {
                "fr": "adapté à une offre",
                "en": "tailored to an offer"
              },
              "template": {
                "fr": "modèle de mise en page",
                "en": "layout template"
              }
            },
            "default": "tailored"
          },
          {
            "name": "offer",
            "type": "link",
            "target": "JobOffer",
            "inverse": "cvs",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Offre",
              "en": "Offer"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "content",
            "type": "long_text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Contenu",
              "en": "Content"
            },
            "help": "Maître et adapté : Markdown. Modèle : une page HTML avec {{contenu}}."
          },
          {
            "name": "appreciation",
            "type": "number",
            "min": 0,
            "max": 100,
            "label": {
              "fr": "Appréciation de l’IA",
              "en": "AI appraisal"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "avis",
            "type": "long_text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Avis",
              "en": "Review"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "state",
            "type": "choice",
            "label": {
              "fr": "État",
              "en": "State"
            },
            "options": ["draft", "ready", "sent"],
            "optionLabels": {
              "draft": {
                "fr": "brouillon",
                "en": "draft"
              },
              "ready": {
                "fr": "prêt (PDF)",
                "en": "ready (PDF)"
              },
              "sent": {
                "fr": "envoyé",
                "en": "sent"
              }
            },
            "default": "draft"
          }
        ],
        "columns": ["role", "offer", "state", "appreciation"]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Criterion",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "Critère de CV",
          "en": "CV criterion"
        },
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "poids",
            "type": "number",
            "min": 0,
            "max": 100,
            "label": {
              "fr": "Poids",
              "en": "Weight"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "instruction",
            "type": "long_text",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Ce que l’IA vérifie",
              "en": "What the AI checks"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "ordre",
            "type": "number",
            "label": {
              "fr": "Ordre",
              "en": "Order"
            }
          }
        ],
        "columns": ["poids", "instruction"]
      }
    }
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "title": "Applications",
      "data": {
        "label": {
          "fr": "Mes candidatures",
          "en": "My applications"
        },
        "order": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "block": "stat",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Nouvelles en IA",
              "en": "New on AI"
            },
            "query": {
              "kind": "JobOffer",
              "where": "status = 'new' and score >= 100",
              "aggregate": {
                "n": "count()"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "block": "stat",
            "title": {
              "fr": "À creuser",
              "en": "To look into"
            },
            "query": {
              "kind": "JobOffer",
              "where": "status = 'interesting'",
              "aggregate": {
                "n": "count()"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "block": "stat",
            "title": {
              "fr": "CV prêts",
              "en": "CVs ready"
            },
            "query": {
              "kind": "CV",
              "where": "state = 'ready'",
              "aggregate": {
                "n": "count()"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "block": "stat",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Candidatures en cours",
              "en": "Applications under way"
            },
            "query": {
              "kind": "Application",
              "where": "status != 'done'",
              "aggregate": {
                "n": "count()"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "block": "table",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Dernière collecte",
              "en": "Last collection"
            },
            "query": {
              "kind": "Execution",
              "where": "service = 'Atelier'",
              "fields": ["status", "started", "error"],
              "sort": "-started",
              "limit": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "block": "task_list",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Nouvelles offres qui correspondent",
              "en": "New offers that fit"
            },
            "kind": "JobOffer",
            "where": "status = 'new' and score >= 100",
            "detail": "reasons",
            "action": {
              "label": "À creuser",
              "set": {
                "status": "interesting"
              }
            },
            "more": [
              {
                "label": "Postulé",
                "set": {
                  "status": "applied"
                }
              },
              {
                "label": "Écarter",
                "set": {
                  "status": "dismissed"
                }
              }
            ],
            "link": "url"
          },
          {
            "block": "kanban",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Mes offres en IA",
              "en": "My AI offers"
            },
            "kind": "JobOffer",
            "by": "status",
            "where": "score >= 100",
            "detail": "company",
            "badge": "score",
            "link": "url",
            "muted": ["dismissed"]
          },
          {
            "block": "table",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Mes CV",
              "en": "My CVs"
            },
            "query": {
              "kind": "CV",
              "fields": ["role", "offer", "state", "appreciation"]
            }
          },
          {
            "block": "table",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Ma grille d’appréciation des CV",
              "en": "My CV grid"
            },
            "query": {
              "kind": "Criterion",
              "fields": ["poids", "instruction"],
              "sort": "ordre"
            }
          },
          {
            "block": "kanban",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Candidatures",
              "en": "Applications"
            },
            "kind": "Application",
            "by": "status"
          },
          {
            "block": "table",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Où je cherche",
              "en": "Where I search"
            },
            "query": {
              "kind": "Source",
              "fields": ["lien", "active", "notes"]
            }
          },
          {
            "block": "form",
            "title": {
              "fr": "Ce que je cherche",
              "en": "What I am looking for"
            },
            "kind": "JobSearch"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "rules": [
    {
      "title": "Offres du matin",
      "data": {
        "when": {
          "schedule": "0 7 * * *"
        },
        "then": [
          {
            "call": {
              "connection": "Atelier",
              "path": "/jobs/parcourir",
              "include": {
                "searches": "JobSearch",
                "sources": "Source"
              },
              "save": {
                "kind": "JobOffer",
                "match": "url",
                "title": "{title}",
                "raw": "Capture"
              },
              "long": true,
              "minutes": 30
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Relance d’une candidature",
      "data": {
        "when": {
          "before": {
            "kind": "Application",
            "field": "due",
            "days": 0
          }
        },
        "if": "status = 'waiting'",
        "then": [
          {
            "remind": {
              "text": "Relancer : {title}"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "scripts": [],
  "role": {
    "covers": {
      "fr": "Ta recherche de stage, d’alternance ou d’emploi : tes critères, les offres trouvées et notées chaque matin, tes candidatures et leurs relances.",
      "en": "Your search for an internship, work-study or job: your criteria, the offers found and scored each morning, your applications and follow-ups."
    },
    "intents": [
      "stage",
      "alternance",
      "emploi",
      "job",
      "offre",
      "offres",
      "candidature",
      "candidater",
      "postuler",
      "postulé",
      "postule",
      "recrutement",
      "recruteur",
      "entretien",
      "cv",
      "lettre de motivation",
      "relance",
      "relancer",
      "cdi",
      "cdd",
      "site d’emploi",
      "sites d’offres"
    ],
    "watches": [
      "JobSearch",
      "Source",
      "JobOffer",
      "Capture",
      "Application",
      "Fichier",
      "CV",
      "Criterion"
    ],
    "reads": ["JobSearch", "Source", "JobOffer", "Capture", "Application", "CV", "Criterion"],
    "writes": ["JobSearch", "Source", "JobOffer", "Application", "CV", "Criterion"],
    "ask": [
      {
        "fr": "Quel poste, où, et quel contrat ?",
        "en": "Which role, where, and which contract?"
      },
      {
        "fr": "Je te propose des sites où chercher ?",
        "en": "Shall I propose sites to search?"
      },
      {
        "fr": "On fixe ta grille d’appréciation des CV ?",
        "en": "Shall we set your CV grid?"
      }
    ],
    "instructions": {
      "fr": "Sa recherche : « JobSearch » (poste, lieu, contrat ; « mots » : une idée par ligne, formes séparées par |). Ses sites : « Source » (recette ; essaie avec parcourir ; « lien » prêt à ouvrir). À 7 h les offres arrivent notées en « JobOffer ». CV : un « CV » maître (Markdown) et un modèle (HTML avec {{contenu}}). Pour une offre : lis-la (parcourir), renseigne-toi sur l’entreprise (chercher), écris un « CV » adapté relié à l’offre, sans rien inventer ; note-le sur 100 avec ses « Criterion » (poids, instruction) : appreciation + avis critère par critère. À 80 ou plus : pdf du modèle rempli, fichier relié, état prêt. Elle postule : une « Application », « due » = relance. Rien n’est envoyé sans son oui.",
      "en": "Her search: « JobSearch » (role, place, contract; « mots »: one idea per line, forms separated by |). Her sites: « Source » (recipe; try with parcourir; « lien » ready to open). At 7 offers arrive scored as « JobOffer ». CVs: a master « CV » (Markdown) and a template (HTML with {{contenu}}). For an offer: read it (parcourir), learn about the company (chercher), write a tailored « CV » linked to the offer, inventing nothing; score it out of 100 with her « Criterion » entries (weight, instruction): appreciation + review per criterion. At 80 or more: pdf of the filled template, file linked, state ready. She applies: an « Application », « due » = follow-up. Nothing is sent without her yes."
    },
    "capabilities": ["chercher", "parcourir", "pdf"],
    "bridges": []
  }
}
